Our story
DevX started as a side project between engineers who were tired of watching valuable customer feedback get buried in GitHub issues, Slack threads, and spreadsheets. Today it's a platform used by product teams to surface what really matters.
Turn every customer signal into your team's next best decision.
Product teams spend enormous effort collecting feedback — from support tickets, GitHub issues, Slack messages, user interviews, and more. But most of it never reaches the people who can act on it. DevX is the connective tissue: an AI-powered layer that normalizes, classifies, scores, and routes feedback from every source so your team can focus on building, not triaging.
10×
faster from feedback to action
8-stage
AI pipeline: normalize → embed → dedup → classify → sentiment → priority → route → digest
7+
integrations: GitHub, GitLab, Slack, Jira, Gmail, Linear, Discord
🎯
Signal over noise
We believe every product team is drowning in data and starving for insight. DevX exists to close that gap.
🔒
Privacy first
Your feedback data is yours. We never sell it, never use it to train models without consent, and treat it with the same care you do.
⚡
Speed matters
A bug report that sits in a backlog for two weeks is a customer lost. We are obsessed with getting the right signal to the right person fast.
🤝
Built for builders
We are developers who got tired of feedback falling through the cracks. Every feature we ship is one we wished existed.
